#: includes/class-plugin.php:302
msgid "Open Settings"
msgstr "Buka Pengaturan"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:374
msgid "Enjoying AstroWay?"
msgstr "AstroWay"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:375
msgid ""
"A short review on wordpress.org helps other site owners discover the plugin,"
" and tells us what to build next."
msgstr ""
"Ulasan singkat di wordpress.org membantu pemilik situs lain menemukan plugin"
" ini, sekaligus memberi masukan kepada kami tentang fitur apa yang sebaiknya"
" kami kembangkan selanjutnya."

#: includes/class-plugin.php:379
msgid "Leave a review"
msgstr "Berikan ulasan"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:442
msgid "This server has used up its anonymous AstroWay quota:"
msgstr "Server ini telah menghabiskan kuota AstroWay anonimnya:"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:443
msgid ""
"the free tier allows this site 300 requests an hour. Until the hour resets, "
"widgets that would have been rendered into the page fall back to a frame "
"loaded by the visitor's own browser, and preview and admin calls from this "
"server will fail. Add a free API key to lift the limit and get 10,000 "
"credits/month plus 60 req/min."
msgstr ""
"Paket gratis ini membatasi situs ini hingga 300 permintaan per jam. Sampai "
"hitungan jam tersebut direset, widget yang seharusnya ditampilkan di halaman"
" akan dialihkan ke bingkai yang dimuat oleh browser pengunjung sendiri, dan "
"panggilan pratinjau serta admin dari server ini akan gagal. Tambahkan kunci "
"API gratis untuk menghapus batasan tersebut dan dapatkan 10.000 kredit per "
"bulan serta 60 permintaan per menit."

#: includes/class-plugin.php:477
msgid ""
"AstroWay can no longer read the saved API key: the security keys in wp-"
"config.php have changed since it was saved. Widgets keep working without it."
msgstr ""
"AstroWay tidak dapat lagi membaca kunci API yang tersimpan: kunci keamanan "
"di wp-config.php telah berubah sejak disimpan. Widget tetap berfungsi tanpa "
"kunci tersebut."

#: includes/class-plugin.php:479
msgid "Paste the key again"
msgstr "Tempelkan kunci tersebut sekali lagi"

#: includes/class-public-client.php:88
msgid ""
"This widget reached the free limit for one visitor (30 requests an hour from"
" one IP address), so visitors on that connection see nothing here until the "
"hour resets. Only administrators see this note."
msgstr ""
"Widget ini telah mencapai batas gratis untuk satu pengunjung (30 permintaan "
"per jam dari satu alamat IP), sehingga pengunjung yang menggunakan koneksi "
"tersebut tidak akan melihat apa pun di sini hingga batas waktu per jam "
"tersebut direset. Hanya administrator yang dapat melihat catatan ini."

